          "reading_mode": "fresh_complete_selected_text_and_matching_image",
          "note": "Read the full text and individually inspected the matching image for physical pages 19–20. Read the entire Lemma 3.3 Gysin proof via p_*q^m=h_(m-1)(K); the antisymmetrized quotient is a symmetric polynomial in Chern classes, with no splitting or inversion of a-b in Chow. Read Lemma 3.4's projection-formula induction, which fixes the rightmost-first operator order for the entire word. Proposition 3.5's complete proof identifies terminal x^mu with prefix top-Chern factors using d_j=mu_j-mu_(j+1) and obtains the weighted pushforward identity; its degree is |mu|+sum epsilon. Row bundles G_(a,t) are actual kernels at their creation stage and completed G_a are thereafter kept fixed under pullback. Recorded the exact row filtration, claimed generated-tail surjection and twisted top-Chern factorization in Proposition 3.6. Only its opening proof paragraph is on this sheet; the generation proof continues on page 21 and is not yet marked complete."
