          "note": "Read the complete text and individually inspected the matching image for physical pages 31–32. Read Propositions 5.5–5.8 in full. The atom reciprocal uses barPi and the same complementary dominant partition, but its local prefactor is the old upper root pulled back from the preceding stage. The projection formula retains that historical factor throughout iteration. Lemma 3.10 and the actual row-start co-row filtrations identify the product with top Chern classes of generated C_a tensor M; terminal prefix factors are generated independently. The resulting generated atom bundle has rank ell+|mu|. Incidence realizes its finite dual, and the reciprocal identity gives the normalized source atom packet over any field, with smooth nonzero realization only in characteristic zero. The minimal weak-composition sorting convention gives the nonzero constant Demazure-atom layer; the minimal excess r_at differs from the reduced-word padding ell and is at most ell. No general operator-cone preservation or generation of each root line is asserted."
