          "reading_mode": "fresh_complete_selected_text_and_matching_image",
          "note": "Read the complete text and individually inspected the matching image for physical pages 73–74. Completed every reference, including exact versions and external proof inputs. IMPORTANT BIBLIOGRAPHIC CORRECTION: reference 26 is Amini–Huh–Larson, A decomposition theorem for Lefschetz modules, arXiv:2511.02026v1, section 4.3 Lemma 4.6; the earlier shorthand AHK in notes 19–21 and 24 is incorrect and must not be used in the source audit or book. Reference 27 is Larson–Partida 2604.21925v1; KM is 2405.03576v2, BEST is 2103.08021v4, and Ardila is math/0404370v1. The simplex formula is Huh 1008.4749 Lemma 36. GHMSW 2506.22415v1, Huh 2601.13249v4 and Jiang–Li 2112.02847v3 have prior full frozen receipts and can only be reused with zero fresh credit. All seventy-four primary physical pages have now received complete-text reading plus thirty-seven individually inspected matching sheets. This is primary proof review, not a second-model universal proof certificate, current worldwide conjecture-status certification or book admission."
